Problem:
Simplify $
\root 3 \of {x \root 3 \of {x \root 3 \of {x \sqrt{x}}}}.
$ Express your answer in simplest radical form in terms of $x$.

Solution:
answer:  Let $y = \sqrt 3 \of {x \root 3 \of {x \root 3 \of {x \sqrt{x}}}}}$. Then we have

$$y = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt[3]{x \sqrt{x}}}} = \boxed{x}.$$
====================

