Problem:
If $\pi=3.1415926...$, what is the exact value of $|\pi-3.14|+|\pi-\frac{22}{7}|$? Express your answer as a common fraction.

Solution:
answer:  We have that $|\pi-3.14|+|\pi-\frac{22}{7}|=|\pi-3.14|+|\frac{22}{7}-\pi|=\frac{1}{7}+\frac{1}{7}=\boxed{\frac{2}{7}}$.
