Problem:
Compute $\dbinom{7}{2}$.

Solution:
answer:  $\dbinom{7}{2} = \frac{7!}{2!(7-2)!} = \frac{7!}{2!5!} = \frac{7 \times 6 \times 5!}{2 \times 1 \times 5!} = \frac{7 \times 6}{2 \times 1} = \boxed{42}$.
