Problem:
Evaluate $|2\omega^2-4\omega-30|$ if $\omega=1-5i$.

Solution:
answer:  We have that

$$2\omega^2-4\omega-30=2(1-5i)^2-4(1-5i)-30=2(1-10i-25)-4+20i-30=-22-10i.$$

Therefore,

$$|2\omega^2-4\omega-30|=\sqrt{(-22)^2+(10)^2}=\sqrt{484+100}=\sqrt{584}=\boxed{2\sqrt{146}}.$$
