Problem:
Find the coefficient of $x^{49}$ in the expansion of
\[(x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 5) \dotsm (x + 95)(x + 97)(x + 99).\]

Solution:
answer:  We can rewrite the expression as
\[(x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 5) \dotsm (x + 95)(x + 97)(x + 99) = (x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 5) \dotsm (x + 95)(x + 97)(x + 99) - (x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 5) \dotsm (x + 95)(x + 97)(x + 99).\]
Thus, the coefficient of $x^{49}$ in the expansion is $\boxed{0}$.
