Problem:
The data in the stem and leaf plot shown are the long jump distances, in centimeters, that the girls team of Pseudo H.S. made at practice today. $(51|1$ represents $511$ centimeters$.)$ What is the sum of the median and mode of the data?

\begin{tabular}{l|lllll}
51& 1\\
52&\\
53& 2& 5\\
54& 0& 2& 2& 5\\
55& 0& 1& 3& 4& 7\\
56& 0& 2& 5\\
57& 0& 1\\
\end{tabular}

Solution:
answer:  First, we list the data in ascending order:

511, 520, 532, 535, 540, 542, 542, 545, 550, 551, 553, 554, 557, 560, 562, 570, 571

The median is the middle value, which is 542.

The mode is the value that appears most frequently, which is 542.

Therefore, the sum of the median and mode is $542 + 542 = \boxed{1084}$.
