Problem:
If $\begin{vmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{vmatrix} = -8,$ then find
\[\begin{vmatrix} b & a \\ d & c \end{vmatrix}.\]

Solution:
answer:  We have that $\begin{vmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{vmatrix} = ad - bc = -8.$ Therefore,

\[\begin{vmatrix} b & a \\ d & c \end{vmatrix} = bc - ad = -(ad - bc) = \boxed{8}.\]
====================

