$$AG = \frac{2}{3}AC$$
$$BG = \frac{2}{3}BC$$

Therefore, we can write:

$$AG = \frac{2}{3}AC = \frac{2}{3} \cdot 22 = 14$$
$$BG = \frac{2}{3}BC = \frac{2}{3} \cdot 31 = 20$$

